      "content": "SP 91 NW                  PITSTONE             CHEDDINGTON ROAD 4/140                                          Nos. 19-22 (consec.),                                                Pitstone Green Cottages. 11.7.78 -                                              II Row of 4 cottages.  C16-C17, altered C18 and C19.  3 bays to left have timber frame with brick infill, remainder refronted in brick C18-C19. Thatched roof, 4 brick chimneys, those to centre C17 and C18.  1½ storeys, 6 bays, 2 bays to right at slight angle to remainder, left bay slightly lower.  4 windows in thatch have 3-light casements, 2 to right with leaded  outer panes, the others with C20 barred wooden lights.  Ground floor has 9 irregular 2 and 3-light similar C20 casements, 2 in blocked doorways.  4 C20 doors, that to No. 20 with thatched hood.  Small C20 extensions to gables and rear.  Interior of No. 22, to right, has timber framing, chamfered spine beams and first floor of right bay on heavy C16 joists. Listing NGR: SP9357315850"
    }
  ],
